	)
	(text_box "1. Function: Mate the Artix Frontend bottom-side receptacles J1/J2 (DF40C-70DS) with two DF40C-70DP plugs on top. Carries all 121 LVCMOS15 ASIC lines (global labels to Router_Interface J5/J6), 15 GND pins, VIN_3V3 (J2.68-70), and VIN_5V provision (J1.32, guarded by GND on J1.30/34).\n\n2. Source / changes: Copied unchanged from FPGA-LDO A V24 / schematic V43 (19 Nov 2026, PIN_MAP_V8.csv; 0 diffs vs Frontend V14/V17/V18). Hirose DF40C-70DP-0.4V(51) data sheet https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/C2692097.pdf (JLC C2692097, 4996 orderable, read 2026-11-25 07:31 CST). Changed for Option B LDO V3: signal labels converted to global labels feeding Sheet 2 (Router_Interface J5/J6); Frontend pinout and copper remain unchanged (only shifted +5.0 mm south on the 22.69 x 40.30 mm board per SYNTHESIS.md section 5)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 490 0)
		(size 165 27)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.3)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
