		(uuid "eabdd4e6-3956-5710-8664-a98a86029014")
	)
	(text_box "1. Function: Seven regulators make the low-voltage ASIC rails from VIN_3V3, feeding both router plugs J5/J6 (Sheet 2): LT3042 (U2 VDD_FE 1.50 V, U6 REF_VDD 1.50 V, U8 REF_VCM 0.75 V with R802 47k minimum load) and TPS7A2015 (U3 VDD_ADC, U4 VDD_DRIVER, U5 DVDD, U7 VDD_CGEN, fixed 1.50 V). TP11-TP17 allow bench probing of every rail.\n\n2. Source / changes: Copied from FPGA-LDO A V24 / schematic V43 (ADI LT3042 https://www.analog.com/media/en/technical-documentation/data-sheets/lt3042.pdf ; TI TPS7A20 SBVS338H Jul 2024 https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps7a20.pdf). Option B LDO V3 fixes (Antigravity, 25 Nov 2026): (a) U3/U4/U5/U7 swapped from TPS7A2015PDQNR X2SON-4 (C2862700, 1 orderable) to genuine TI TPS7A2015PDBVR SOT-23-5 (C2877859, 467 orderable, read 2026-11-25 07:31 CST; pins renumbered per SBVS338H p.4: IN 1, GND 2, EN 3, N/C 4, OUT 5 — matching Carrier V7); (b) all 11 regulator 1 uF 0402 caps (C203, C301-C803) unified from C14445 (10 V Extended) to C52923 (Samsung 25 V Basic, same 0402 land, matching C51-C67); (c) added TP13 on ASIC_VDD_DRIVER. Unverified: per-rail ASIC current budget & SOT-23-5 placement fit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 422 402 0)
		(size 300 22.5)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
