	)
	(text_box "1. Function: JP1/JP2 connect the on-board LT3582-12 outputs to the stimulation LDO inputs. Cut both to feed STIM_PRE_POS/NEG from a bench supply on TP8/TP9 (return: TP6 AGND), as LDO Board A did.\n\n2. Source / changes: Claude design. LDO Board A took INPUT_VDD10/INPUT_VSS10 from outside (Reference/LDO Board A J15/J8). Limits: LT3042 IN <= 20 V, LT3094 IN >= -20 V (ADI data sheets, Absolute Maximum Ratings); keep >= 1.5 V headroom over the +/-8.06 V outputs (V34). Leave U1 unfitted, or its outputs open, when external +/-V is used. Unverified: external source noise."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330 234 0)
		(size 78 36)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
