		(uuid "958cd2d8-73d3-5518-813d-fcbaf7a3898f")
	)
	(text_box "1. Function: C1/C2 decouple VIN_3V3 arriving from Frontend J2.68-70. R1 (10k) and C3 (4.7 uF) delay EN_ASIC_RAILS by about 23 ms (tau = 47 ms) so Frontend VCCO_1V5 is solid before the ASIC rails rise. TP1 (VIN_3V3), TP4 (EN_ASIC_RAILS), TP5 (GND), TP6 (AGND) are bring-up probe pads; PWR_FLAGs flag VIN_3V3, GND and AGND. The single AGND-GND star tie NT1 sits on Sheet 2 (Router_Interface) beside the J5/J6 AGND/GND ties.\n\n2. Source / changes: Copied from FPGA-LDO A V24 / schematic V43 (19 Nov 2026; Claude design). Changed for Option B LDO V3 by Antigravity: NT1 moved to Sheet 2 beside J5/J6; C1/C2 voltage fields verified against JLC C602037 (25 V) and C307331 (50 V). Steady-state EN_ASIC_RAILS ~2.86 V accounting for LT3582 222k internal SHDN pull-down (ADI 3582512fb p.8) and LT3094 EN/UV bias."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 410 60 0)
		(size 135 29.2)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
